#. Context: Settings › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:615
msgid "Discount to fair value required for a BUY."
msgstr "Vereiste korting op de intrinsieke waarde voor een BUY."

#. Context: Settings › slider label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:618
msgid "BUY score threshold"
msgstr "BUY-scoredrempel"

#. Context: Settings › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:620
msgid "Composite score required for a BUY signal."
msgstr "Vereiste totaalscore voor een BUY-signaal."

#. Context: Settings › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:625
msgid "Screening style"
msgstr "Screeningstijl"

#. Context: Settings › Screening style description. Style names must match the
#. options below.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:626
msgid ""
"Which signals lead the composite score — Value tilts to margin of safety "
"& quality, Growth to momentum, Income to dividends."
msgstr ""
"Welke signalen de totaalscore sturen: Waarde legt de nadruk op "
"veiligheidsmarge en kwaliteit, Groei op momentum, Inkomen op dividenden."

#. Context: Settings › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:630
msgid "Benchmark — Euro Stoxx 50"
msgstr "Benchmark: Euro Stoxx 50"

#. Context: Settings › benchmark toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:631
msgid "Overlay on the portfolio value chart."
msgstr "Toon over de grafiek met de waarde van de portefeuille."

#. Context: Settings › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:633
msgid "Include US-listed names"
msgstr "Amerikaanse aandelen opnemen"

#. Context: Settings › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:634
msgid "Extend the screener beyond European exchanges."
msgstr "Breid de screener uit tot buiten de Europese beurzen."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:670
msgid "Target allocation"
msgstr "Doelverdeling"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:671
msgid ""
"Your personal reference weights. When any are set, the Risk page's "
"rebalancing signals switch from absolute thresholds to drift-vs-target."
msgstr ""
"Je persoonlijke referentiegewichten. Zodra er één is ingesteld, schakelen"
" de herbalanceringssignalen op de Risico-pagina over van absolute "
"drempels naar afwijking t.o.v. het doel."

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:676 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:679
msgid "Sector targets"
msgstr "Sectordoelen"

#. Context: Settings › Sector targets description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:677
#, no-python-format
msgid "Blank = no sector targets; the 30% guideline applies instead."
msgstr "Leeg = geen sectordoelen; dan geldt de richtlijn van 30%."

#. Context: Settings › Sector targets › example text inside the empty box.
#. Sector names in the example should be the translated ones.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:681
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"One per line — sector and target %:\n"
"Technology 25\n"
"Healthcare 15"
msgstr ""
"Eén per regel: sector en doel %:\n"
"Technologie 25\n"
"Gezondheidszorg 15"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:684 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:687
msgid "Per-name targets"
msgstr "Doelen per aandeel"

#. Context: Settings › Per-name targets description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:685
#, no-python-format
msgid "Blank = no per-name targets; only the 20% hard cap applies."
msgstr "Leeg = geen doelen per aandeel; alleen het harde maximum van 20% geldt."

#. Context: Settings › Per-name targets › example text inside the empty box.
#. Use the local decimal separator in 7.5.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:689
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"One per line — ticker and target %:\n"
"AAA.BR 10\n"
"BBB.PA 7.5"
msgstr ""
"Eén per regel: ticker en doel %:\n"
"AAA.BR 10\n"
"BBB.PA 7,5"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:693 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:696
msgid "Concentration ceiling (HHI)"
msgstr "Concentratieplafond (HHI)"

#. Context: Settings › HHI description. Use the local decimal separator.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:694
msgid ""
"Flag when portfolio HHI exceeds this. 0 = use the default 0.10 / 0.18 "
"bands."
msgstr ""
"Markeer wanneer de HHI van de portefeuille dit overschrijdt. 0 = "
"standaardbanden 0,10 / 0,18."

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › save button
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:701
msgid "Save target allocation"
msgstr "Doelverdeling opslaan"

#. Context: Settings › toast after saving
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:713
msgid "Target allocation saved."
msgstr "Doelverdeling opgeslagen."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:718
msgid "Data"
msgstr "Gegevens"

#. Context: Settings › Data › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:731
msgid "Price refresh interval"
msgstr "Vernieuwingsinterval koersen"

#. Context: Settings › Data › refresh interval description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:732
msgid "How often quotes update during market hours."
msgstr "Hoe vaak de koersen tijdens de beursuren worden bijgewerkt."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:750
msgid "Ex-dividend alerts"
msgstr "Meldingen ex-dividend"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:751
msgid "Flag holdings going ex-dividend within 7 days on the Dashboard."
msgstr "Markeer op het dashboard posities die binnen 7 dagen ex-dividend gaan."

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider label under Ex-dividend alerts
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:761
msgid "Only above this position weight"
msgstr "Alleen boven dit positiegewicht"

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider value when set to 0%
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:762
msgid "any size"
msgstr "elke grootte"

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:763
#, no-python-format
msgid "0% flags every held ex-date; raise it to only badge your larger positions."
msgstr ""
"Bij 0% wordt elke ex-datum van je posities gemarkeerd; verhoog het om "
"alleen je grotere posities te markeren."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:774
msgid "Dividend cut / suspension alerts"
msgstr "Meldingen dividendverlaging / -stopzetting"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:775
msgid ""
"Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just cut or "
"suspended."
msgstr ""
"Markeer een positie op het dashboard als het dividend net werd verlaagd "
"of stopgezet."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:783
msgid "Dividend increase alerts"
msgstr "Meldingen dividendverhoging"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:784
msgid "Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just raised."
msgstr "Markeer een positie op het dashboard als het dividend net werd verhoogd."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:793
msgid "Dividend withholding"
msgstr "Bronheffing op dividenden"

#. Context: Settings › Dividend withholding description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:794
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Default withholding tax % applied when you record a dividend on each "
"exchange — always editable per record. Depends on your own tax residency "
"and treaty, which this app has no way to know, so every rate starts at 0%"
" until you set it."
msgstr ""
"Standaardpercentage bronheffing dat wordt toegepast wanneer je een "
"dividend per beurs registreert; per record altijd aan te passen. Het "
"hangt af van je eigen fiscale woonplaats en belastingverdrag, die de app "
"niet kan kennen, dus elk tarief begint op 0% tot je het instelt."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:814
msgid "Import & export"
msgstr "Importeren en exporteren"

#. Context: Settings › Import portfolio description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:821
msgid ""
"Upload an Excel file to import positions, sold history and dividends. "
"This replaces all existing portfolio data for this account."
msgstr ""
"Upload een Excel-bestand om posities, verkoophistoriek en dividenden te "
"importeren. Dit vervangt alle bestaande portefeuillegegevens van dit "
"account."

#. Context: Settings › file upload label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:822
msgid "Choose your portfolio .xlsx file"
msgstr "Kies je .xlsx-portefeuillebestand"

#. Context: Settings › loading message during import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:825
msgid "Parsing Excel…"
msgstr "Excel wordt verwerkt…"

#. Context: Settings › import error. Keep the exchange codes as they are.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:829
msgid ""
"No open EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX: positions found. Check that your "
"file matches the expected format."
msgstr ""
"Geen open EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX:-posities gevonden. Controleer of "
"je bestand het verwachte formaat heeft."

#. Context: Settings › success message after import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:838
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Imported {open} open, {sold} sold, {dividends} dividend records."
msgstr "Geïmporteerd: {open} open, {sold} verkocht, {dividends} dividendrecords."

#. Context: Settings › import error; {error} is a technical message (stays
#. English)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:842
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not parse file: {error}"
msgstr "Kon het bestand niet verwerken: {error}"

#. Context: Settings › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:847
msgid "Excel export"
msgstr "Excel-export"

#. Context: Settings › Excel export description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:848
msgid ""
"Human-readable workbook with positions, dividends, sold history and "
"watchlist. Useful for inspection or migration."
msgstr ""
"Leesbare werkmap met posities, dividenden, verkoophistoriek en volglijst."
" Handig om na te kijken of te migreren."

#. Context: Settings › download button (keep the file name)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:852
msgid "Download backup.xlsx"
msgstr "backup.xlsx downloaden"

#. Context: Settings › export notice
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:858
msgid ""
"Your portfolio is empty. Add positions in the Portfolio section first, "
"then come back to export."
msgstr ""
"Je portefeuille is leeg. Voeg eerst posities toe in Portefeuille en kom "
"dan terug om te exporteren."

#. Context: Settings › export error; {error} is technical (stays English)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:860
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not create Excel: {error}"
msgstr "Kon het Excel-bestand niet aanmaken: {error}"

#. Context: Watchlist › caption under the title
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:66
msgid ""
"Track tickers you don't hold yet. Add from the screener with the star, or"
" type a symbol directly below."
msgstr ""
"Volg tickers die je nog niet bezit. Voeg ze toe vanuit de screener met de"
" ster, of typ hieronder rechtstreeks een symbool."

#. Context: Watchlist › submit button
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:98
msgid "Add ticker"
msgstr "Ticker toevoegen"

#. Context: Watchlist › field label
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:107 uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:109
msgid "Company name (optional)"
msgstr "Bedrijfsnaam (optioneel)"

#. Context: Watchlist › empty state
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:143
msgid "Your watchlist is empty. Star a ticker in the screener or add one above."
msgstr ""
"Je volglijst is leeg. Geef een ticker een ster in de screener of voeg er "
"hierboven een toe."

#. Context: Watchlist › loading caption
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fetching data for your {count} watchlisted ticker… {done}/{total} "
"companies scored."
msgid_plural ""
"Fetching data for your {count} watchlisted tickers… {done}/{total} "
"companies scored."
msgstr[0] ""
"Gegevens ophalen voor je {count} ticker op de volglijst… {done}/{total} "
"bedrijven gescoord."
msgstr[1] ""
"Gegevens ophalen voor je {count} tickers op de volglijst… {done}/{total} "
"bedrijven gescoord."

#. Context: Watchlist › note when data isn't loaded yet
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:158
msgid ""
"No screener data yet for your watchlisted ticker — it will appear after "
"the next screener refresh."
msgid_plural ""
"No screener data yet for your watchlisted tickers — they'll appear after "
"the next screener refresh."
msgstr[0] ""
"Nog geen screenergegevens voor je ticker op de volglijst; die verschijnen"
" na de volgende vernieuwing van de screener."
msgstr[1] ""
"Nog geen screenergegevens voor je tickers op de volglijst; ze verschijnen"
" na de volgende vernieuwing van de screener."

